{
  "_about": {
    "chapter": "Enemies and encounters: what each enemy kind starts with, the drones, the Triumvirate and Lilitu, their hazards, and the Horde Gauntlet.",
    "how_to_edit": "Plain JSON, inlined by tools/build.mjs as GAME_DB.enemies and checked by tools/test-game-db.cjs. Times are seconds unless a name says frames (60 a second); distances px; damage HP. Keys in UPPER_SNAKE are read by the code under those names. Gauntlet ids and kind ids are in save files: never rename one.",
    "tables": {
      "kinds": "Each enemy class's starting numbers, read by its constructor (entities/enemies.js, entities/hunters.js, entities/drones.js); a spawn can still pass its own hp, speed or vision range. ganger.gun is the gun a ganger with no weapon carries (and the fallback for any stat a weapon leaves out). hunter.weapon is an ITEM or weapon-model id. demoness.decoy is a Blood Mirror decoy's claw and whip. gatling_gunner burst_count shots burst_delay frames apart, then reload frames.",
      "drone": "The drones (DRONE, entities/drones.js): HP, armour and how much the open eye takes; how they descend, hover and land; the bolt; and each kind's move (LANCE, GRAPPLE, BEAM) and keep-away distance (KEEP).",
      "drone_kinds": "The drone kinds, one picked at random when a spawn names none (DRONE_KINDS).",
      "duel": "Lilitu's duel (DUEL, entities/hunters.js): phase thresholds P2 and P3 as shares of her health; SIGIL_EVERY and SIGILS per phase; her bolt fan, Shadow Step, Wing Gale, Blood Mirror and Infernal Rite.",
      "wardens": "The Triumvirate's three wardens (WARDENS): name and colours (eye is an r, g, b string).",
      "warden": "How the wardens fight (WARDEN): HP each; RELOAD and STAGGER in frames; EXTEND shots; COVER_FIRE and FLANK_AFTER in seconds; each one's move: Vesper's censer, Matins' hymn, Compline's hook.",
      "triumvirate": "Where the wardens kneel in the Sanctum (TRIUMVIRATE, engine/boss-intro.js): [x, y, squad index, warden id].",
      "hazards": "The bosses' hazards (HAZARD, engine/boss-hazards.js): sigils, burning, the censer's fire and smoke, the hymn, the hook, the rite.",
      "gauntlet_maps": "The Horde Gauntlet's maps (GAUNTLET_MAPS): mapId is a map in world/maps.js; spawns and gunnerSpawns are [x, y]; locked ones show as Sealed. hooks names the wave rule in entities/enemies.js (GAUNTLET_WAVE_HOOKS); a map without one uses the standard waves.",
      "gauntlet": "The gauntlet's rules: spawn_min_dist px from her; scale (GAUNTLET_SCALE): from wave FROM, HP x HP_GROWTH and damage + DMG_STEP a wave; elites from ELITE_FROM, about one in ELITE_EVERY; SCRAP x wave a cleared wave, BONUS_SCRAP every BONUS_EVERY-th; the Demoness' HP with her hunters and alone. lead_err px: how far off a wave's first guess of where she is; stall_secs and stall_err: a vaguer lead when no one has found her.",
      "elites": "The elite marks (ELITES): label and colour (r, g, b); ward (ELITE_WARD): the warded elite's front arc in radians either side and the share of its health it turns away."
    }
  },
